{"id":"47215f88c6df0b12","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive.md","title":"73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive — pcp nonrecursive","display":"73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive — pcp nonrecursive","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive","display":"73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive — pcp nonrecursive","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]","[[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]","[[73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive","73-theorem-5.5"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive — pcp nonrecursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" href=\"?note=3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" title=\"73-df-binary-pcp-coding\">73-df-binary-pcp-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"749da0bcf0da6c50\" href=\"?note=749da0bcf0da6c50\" title=\"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-nonrecursive</span><span>73-theorem-5.5</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PCP}\">\\(\\mathrm{PCP}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" href=\"?note=3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" title=\"73-df-binary-pcp-coding\">73-df-binary-pcp-coding</a> 中使用其固定编码的二进制 PCP 语言；每个实例是有限非空词对列表，解索引列必须非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"285f46d94947b99e\" href=\"?note=285f46d94947b99e\" title=\"73-df-recursive-language-notation\">73-df-recursive-language-notation</a> 的二进制语言实例；不可判定性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"749da0bcf0da6c50\" href=\"?note=749da0bcf0da6c50\" title=\"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability\">73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PCP}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PCP},\\qquad\\mathrm{PCP}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PCP}\\coloneqq\\mathsf{PCP},\\qquad\\mathrm{PCP}\\notin\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","status":"resolved","id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-recursive-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-recursive-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability","status":"resolved","id":"749da0bcf0da6c50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-pcp-undecidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","statu